    "description": "Tanaka Co.,Ltd. engages in the wholesale of electrical materials and appliances in Japan. The company offers fluorescent lighting fixtures, incandescent lighting fixtures, hid fixtures, explosion-proof fixtures, ventilation fans, duct fans, and led fixtures; high-voltage and low-voltage power cables, communication cables, insulated power distribution cables, synthetic rubber electric wires, steel conduits, polyvinyl chloride conduits, flexible synthetic resin conduits, and various accessories. It also provides high-voltage power receiving equipment, power distribution boards, distribution boards, control equipment, wiring devices, electrical circuit equipment, communication equipment, disaster prevention equipment, and acoustic equipment; home appliances, housing equipment, office equipment, and solar power generation equipment; and concrete pillars, steel pipe poles, overhead wiring materials, measuring equipment, power tools, and security equipment. The company's products are used for parks, roads, buildings, apartment complexes, factories, and detached houses, power supply and receiving equipment; home appliances, including air conditioners for households, shops, and offices. The company was founded in 1950 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan."
